<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>

  <!--
    RUT_Webwork                                    UtinniPatches - authored 2026-09-09
    BIOME_OWNERSHIP_WAVE_1. Full sheet: design/Jawa/worldbuilding/biomes/
    the_webwork.md (FROZEN). Replaces the donor `AB_FeraliskInfestedJungle` (Alpha
    Biomes). The species keeps both its names by standing ruling: Wyyyschokk to the
    galaxy, Feralisk on this world.

    MEASURED live on V26 (sheet SS0): 161 tiles, 0 river tiles, 0 water tiles ("the
    water is inside," §1, §5 — now literally true on the map per the 2026-09-08
    amendment). Sun median +51 deg. Temp p10/median/p90 38.6/49.2/58.2 C.

    animalDensity CORRECTED HARD from the donor's 5.4: sheet SS0 rules this
    explicitly — "Corrected — animalDensity 5.4 inverts to low-but-lethal: this
    jungle's ordinary wildlife has been eaten (§4b)." Dropped to 1.0 as a DESIGNED
    interim (same pattern RUT_TheScald/RUT_GreySea used for their own animalDensity)
    — a real quicktest tune against how the Wyyyschokk's own predation numbers land
    is still owed. plantDensity kept high (donor 0.9): the thicket "churns against
    itself" (SS4c) and is explicitly dense, unlike the animal population.

    Weather has no sheet-named signature event beyond "eerily silent" (SS1) and
    "direct sunlight is lethal to the owners; clearings are the only safe ground"
    (SS5) — read as a mechanic (light-moat, SS7b), not a weather-commonality field.
    Kept close to the donor's own jungle table with Clear raised to dominant (a
    silent, sun-capped canopy jungle, not a storm-driven one); Snow zeroed (58 C max
    temp makes it absurd).

    wildAnimals/wildPlants: transplanted from BiomeCast_Ashkarr.xml /
    BiomeFlora_Ashkarr.xml against rosters/the_webwork.json. 🔴 CORRECTION
    (this file, review pass): an earlier draft of this comment claimed the
    Wyyyschokk/Feralisk is never placed as a wildAnimals entry — that is WRONG.
    rosters/the_webwork.json §fauna explicitly lands it at commonality 0.4,
    action "import" (§4's "THE species... dormant-until-triggered"), and it is
    present below. Ban 1 ("no tamed/traded/negotiated Wyyyschokk") is a
    TAMEABILITY restriction on the RaceDef, not a ban on wild commonality-rolled
    spawning — the two are independent fields; nothing here contradicts the ban.

    NOT this pass's scope: `WEBWORK_MECHANICS_1` in full (web-sense MapComponent,
    Shokk-bound hediff, the light-moat, commandable adhesion, beetle/mite mechanics,
    margin creep); `SHOKKWEAVE_SOLE_SOURCE_1`; any world repaint.

    WEBWORK_KIT_BUILD_1 amendment (this pass): modExtensions below adds
    RM_FrontCreepExtension (webwork_kit_spec.md §6, "margin creep") — read by
    RM_MapComponent_FrontCreep off THIS biome when it is a NEIGHBOR of some
    other map, never off that map's own biome. World map is never repainted;
    this only tells a bordering map what to scatter inward and how fast.
    Numbers are ❓INVENTED (spec names none), a live-balance pass is owed.

  -->

  <BiomeDef>
    <defName>RUT_Webwork</defName>
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="RimMandrake.CreatureBehaviors.RM_FrontCreepExtension">
        <frontThingDefNames>
          <li>RUT_Webwork_Anchor</li>
          <li>RUT_Webwork_Web</li>
          <li>RUT_Webwork_Gutter</li>
        </frontThingDefNames>
        <advanceIntervalTicks>60000</advanceIntervalTicks>
        <maxBandDepth>10</maxBandDepth>
        <spawnDensity>0.15</spawnDensity>
      </li>
    </modExtensions>
    <label>the Webwork</label>
    <description>The place where the plants grew so dense and thick that they drank their entire river -- soaked it up into a thicket of terrible, nightmare plants ever churning against itself. The map shows a jungle with no water because the water is inside. It is eerily silent -- most of the animals have been eaten, and few will enter. Those who do frequently discover a shadow, seconds before it lands upon them, and know nothing more.</description>
    <workerClass>AlphaBiomes.BiomeWorker_FeraliskInfestedJungle</workerClass>
    <foragedFood>RawBerries</foragedFood>
    <allowRoads>true</allowRoads>
    <allowRivers>true</allowRivers>
    <allowFarmingCamps>true</allowFarmingCamps>
    <animalDensity>1.0</animalDensity>
    <plantDensity>0.9</plantDensity>
    <forageability>1.0</forageability>
    <movementDifficulty>2</movementDifficulty>
    <texture>Biomes/AB_FeraliskInfestedJungle</texture>
    <diseaseMtbDays>35</diseaseMtbDays>
    <diseases>
      <li>
        <diseaseInc>Disease_Malaria</diseaseInc>
        <commonality>160</commonality>
      </li>
      <li>
        <diseaseInc>Disease_SleepingSickness</diseaseInc>
        <commonality>140</commonality>
      </li>
      <li>
        <diseaseInc>Disease_Flu</diseaseInc>
        <commonality>100</commonality>
      </li>
      <li>
        <diseaseInc>Disease_Plague</diseaseInc>
        <commonality>100</commonality>
      </li>
      <li>
        <diseaseInc>Disease_GutWorms</diseaseInc>
        <commonality>80</commonality>
      </li>
      <li>
        <diseaseInc>Disease_MuscleParasites</diseaseInc>
        <commonality>80</commonality>
      </li>
    </diseases>
    <terrainsByFertility>
      <li>
        <terrain>AB_DenseMud</terrain>
        <min>-999</min>
        <max>0.35</max>
      </li>
      <li>
        <terrain>AB_DenseGrass</terrain>
        <min>0.35</min>
        <max>0.87</max>
      </li>
      <li>
        <terrain>SoilRich</terrain>
        <min>0.87</min>
        <max>999</max>
      </li>
    </terrainsByFertility>
    <baseWeatherCommonalities>
      <Clear>50</Clear>
      <Fog>5</Fog>
      <Rain>5</Rain>
      <DryThunderstorm>1</DryThunderstorm>
      <RainyThunderstorm>5</RainyThunderstorm>
      <FoggyRain>3</FoggyRain>
      <SnowGentle>0</SnowGentle>
      <SnowHard>0</SnowHard>
    </baseWeatherCommonalities>
    <wildAnimals>
      <Wyyyschokk MayRequire="mlie.starwarsanimalcollection">0.4</Wyyyschokk>  <!-- wyyyschokk - owner, import -->
      <RSW_JewelBeetle MayRequire="mandrake.rsw.swbestiary">0.3</RSW_JewelBeetle>  <!-- jewel beetle - anchor-beetle, import -->
      <Kreetle MayRequire="mlie.starwarsanimalcollection">0.2</Kreetle>  <!-- kreetle - trace-prey, adjust-keep -->
      <Shyrack MayRequire="mlie.starwarsanimalcollection">0.2</Shyrack>  <!-- shyrack - trace-flier, keep -->
    </wildAnimals>
    <coastalWildAnimals />
    <wildPlants>
      <AB_JungleTree>1.1</AB_JungleTree>  <!-- deep jungle tree - tree -->
      <RG_Plant_TropicalChokevine>1.0</RG_Plant_TropicalChokevine>  <!-- chokevine -->
      <AB_TangleTea>0.4</AB_TangleTea>  <!-- tangle tea -->
      <Plant_TookeTrap_Wild>0.3</Plant_TookeTrap_Wild>  <!-- wild tooke-trap plant -->
      <AB_Gomphoeria>0.15</AB_Gomphoeria>  <!-- gomphoeria -->
      <AB_RedBugloss>0.07</AB_RedBugloss>  <!-- red bugloss -->
      <AB_Aaklac>0.05</AB_Aaklac>  <!-- aaklac -->
    </wildPlants>
    <wildPlantRegrowDays>15</wildPlantRegrowDays>
  </BiomeDef>

</Defs>
